- At least four paid customers.
- Revenue of at least $45.00.
- Average satisfaction of paid customers of at least 60.

A useful defeat example misses one target while meeting the others, because it demonstrates that all three conditions are required. Confirm the actual outcome by running the script before describing it as evidence.

